{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "module": "WM",
  "area": "classic warehouse management (LE-WM): transfer orders, transfer requirements, stock, bins, posting changes, inventory",
  "notes": [
    "Business actions for /sc4sap:assist, executed only through ZMCP_BIZ_EXECUTE on the SAP side (handler ZCL_MCP_BIZ_WM).",
    "Classic WM (LE-WM) on ECC only. On S/4HANA the warehouse runs in EWM, which is out of scope: every WM action is refused there.",
    "The L_TO_* / L_TR_CREATE function modules have no test mode: previews check status, bins, stock, configuration and authorization; L_TR_CREATE_CHECK checks a transfer requirement row.",
    "Not offered: bin block changes (L_LAGP_VERAENDERN is internal), WM inventory count and clearing (LI11 / LI20 / LI21 are runs), confirmation with differences, replenishment runs.",
    "The handler checks L_LGNUM (warehouse / storage type) and L_BWLVS (movement type) itself and refuses when a check fails (fail closed).",
    "No person names are returned (TO creator / confirmer / counter fields are left out)."
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "id": "WM.TO.LIST_OPEN",
      "object": "Transfer order",
      "kind": "query",
      "risk": "none",
      "title": "List open transfer orders of a warehouse (or all TOs of a delivery)",
      "intents": {
        "en": [
          "open transfer orders",
          "transfer orders not confirmed",
          "TOs of a delivery"
        ],
        "ko": [
          "미결 이전오더",
          "미확정 TO",
          "납품의 TO"
        ]
      },
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "lgnum",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "lgtyp",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "description": "source or destination storage type of an item"
        },
        {
          "name": "vbeln",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "description": "delivery: lists its TOs, open and confirmed"
        },
        {
          "name": "max_rows",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false
        }
      ],
      "clarify": [
        {
          "param": "lgnum",
          "ask": "Which warehouse number?",
          "when": "lgnum is missing"
        }
      ],
      "impl": {
        "ECC": {
          "source": [
            "LTAK",
            "LTAP"
          ],
          "note": "SELECT LTAK (KQUIT = space = open) with item counts from LTAP; BAPI_WHSE_TO_GET_LIST exists but needs range tables"
        },
        "S4": {
          "fm": "none",
          "note": "not offered on S/4HANA (warehouse = EWM, out of scope)"
        }
      },
      "auth": [
        {
          "object": "L_LGNUM",
          "fields": {
            "LGNUM": "<warehouse>",
            "LGTYP": "<storage type or DUMMY>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "verified_on": [
        {
          "alias": "ECC740-DEV",
          "family": "ECC",
          "release": "740",
          "date": "2026-11-10",
          "level": "scenario",
          "evidence": "configs/WM/actions-evidence/ECC740-DEV.txt"
        }
      ]
    },
